
===== PARTNER VERDICT (codex, 1328s) =====

Implemented S1b in [src/App.tsx](z:/328/CMPUT328-A2/codexworks/301/language/src/App.tsx:633).

What changed:
- Added routes/views: `/ja/path` and `/ja/lesson/<id>`, with lesson ID carried in `route.sceneId`.
- Added `RoadmapView`, `LessonPlayer`, `LessonProgressHeader`, `LessonVocabStep`, `LessonGrammarStep`, `LessonReaderStep`, `LessonCheckStep`, `LessonComplete`, `WordStudyCard`, and `GrammarStudyCard`.
- Made Japanese entry primary: LanguagePicker now opens `#/ja/path`, and bare `#/ja` defaults to `path`.
- Header now has prominent `Lessons`, with existing Learn/Scenes/Review/Grammar/Kanji/etc. still reachable under a visible `Practice` label.
- Lesson completion is guarded in `LessonComplete`: it calls `progress.markLessonComplete(lesson)` from an effect only if the lesson is not already complete and the mounted completion screen has not already recorded that lesson ID.

Verification:
- `npx tsc -b` rc `0`
- `npm run build` rc `0`
- `npm test` rc `0`, 38 tests passed

I also did a non-preview local dev smoke on `http://127.0.0.1:4174/language/`, `#/ja/path`, and `#/ja/lesson/ja-lesson-1?step=0`; all returned HTTP 200 app shells. The dev server was stopped.

